## 8. Testing & Quality Gates

```bash
pre-commit run --all-files     # format + lint
ruff check src/ tests/         # lint
mypy src/                      # static types
pytest -q                      # unit tests
pytest --cov=<package> --cov-report=term-missing   # coverage
```

Required to merge:

- All CI jobs green on the pinned Python matrix
- Coverage not reduced relative to `main`
- At least one maintainer approval
- No unresolved review threads

